WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.714
Open the PDF you want to edit.

2
00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:07.840
Pick the page with the text you want to change.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.240
Click Edit text.

4
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.510
Then click the line you want to change.

5
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.524
Type the new text, and press Enter.

6
00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:21.090
Finally, click Save PDF to download your edited copy.

7
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.776
The rest of the page stays exactly as it was.
